# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECRETS — this repo is PUBLIC. Nothing below ever gets committed.
# A secret committed and later deleted still lives in git history.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pem
*.key
key.properties
android/key.properties
app/android/key.properties
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets.json
service-account*.json
google-services.json

# Never commit real user data or captured messages
**/sms_dump*
**/*.sms.json
**/testdata/real/
fixtures/real/

